{
  "name": "background-task-short",
  "steps": [
    {
      "afterMs": 0,
      "event": {
        "kind": "request",
        "text": "背景で待つあいだの帯を、再開まで数秒の短い版で見たい（架空の依頼）",
        "images": []
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 300,
      "event": {
        "kind": "speech",
        "text": "背景で少しだけ走らせておくね。",
        "expression": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 600,
      "event": {
        "kind": "tool-started",
        "toolUseId": "fake-tool-background-short-1",
        "name": "Bash",
        "input": {
          "command": "sleep 2",
          "run_in_background": true,
          "description": "架空の短い待ち（2秒）"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 700,
      "event": {
        "kind": "tool-finished",
        "toolUseId": "fake-tool-background-short-1",
        "content": "架空の背景実行の受付（ID: fake-bg-short-1）",
        "isError": false
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 700,
      "event": {
        "kind": "background-tasks-changed",
        "tasks": [
          {
            "taskId": "fake-bg-short-1",
            "kind": "shell",
            "description": "架空の短い待ち（2秒）"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 1200,
      "event": {
        "kind": "utterance",
        "text": "## 背景で1件、短く走らせた\n\nこれは架空の本文で、実物の会話ではない。**`background-task` の長い版（再開まで12秒超）とは別に、E2E で繰り返し撮れるように再開まで数秒に縮めた版**。帯の「いまの作業」が「背景で作業中」になり、終わると「依頼待ち」に戻る。"
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 1500,
      "event": {
        "kind": "turn-finished",
        "outcome": {
          "kind": "completed"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 2500,
      "event": {
        "kind": "background-tasks-changed",
        "tasks": []
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 2600,
      "event": {
        "kind": "turn-resumed"
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 2900,
      "event": {
        "kind": "speech",
        "text": "短い背景の待ちが終わったよ。",
        "expression": "proud"
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 3200,
      "event": {
        "kind": "utterance",
        "text": "## 短い背景の待ちが終わった\n\nこれは架空の本文で、実物の会話ではない。**依頼なしで始めた続きのターン**の報告で、前の本文は中間レポートに回る。"
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 3500,
      "event": {
        "kind": "turn-finished",
        "outcome": {
          "kind": "completed"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
